This repository contains two layers with different licence terms.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
1. The text of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 (the EU AI Act)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

The body text of all Articles, Recitals, and Annexes — contained in the JSON
files under data/<lang>/ — is published by the European Union.

Reuse is authorised under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU of 12 December
2011 on the reuse of Commission documents (OJ L 330, 14.12.2011, p. 39),
provided that the source is acknowledged.

  https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32011D0833

